  (text "Node: both open = 0x10 (audio bridge), JP1 = 0x11, JP2 = 0x12." (at 15 322 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "347a6006-7f97-5725-8674-662c0dde5a7c"))
  (text "MAX5134 (16-bit, SPI up to 30 MHz): 4 buffered outputs, internal 2.44 V reference (REFO -> REFI), full scale 2.44 V, midscale 1.22 V.\nM/Z high = outputs power up at midscale (no step into the DC-block caps). LDAC pulled high: use the write-through command per channel,\nor pulse LDAC from GPIO21 to update all four together. Every frame: 4 x 24 bits, so 96 kHz per channel needs a 9.2 MHz clock." (at 330 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "caabf022-63b4-5889-9d09-f8f29fe2e9e6"))
