  (text "Per channel: 2nd-order Sallen-Key low-pass (3.9k / 3.9k, 2.2n feedback / 1n to ground, about 27 kHz, Q 0.74) to strip the sample images,\nthen a 10u DC block (the DAC idles at 1.22 V), 47k to ground, 100 R in series with the jack. Full scale about 0.86 Vrms. Use C0G/NP0 for the 1n / 2.2n caps." (at 300 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d0cc8ff7-ba5d-51ee-8a9c-4551cbc1f138"))
